WEBVTT

00:07.674 --> 00:08.508
Hello, Mom?

00:09.718 --> 00:14.889
Woo-jin and Mr. Moon got hurt,
so we're at the ER.

00:15.557 --> 00:17.017
Are they badly hurt?

00:18.101 --> 00:21.062
Woo-jin has a knife wound
on his left hand,

00:21.646 --> 00:23.481
and Mr. Moon has a gash on his forehead.

00:23.565 --> 00:24.774
My goodness…

00:26.026 --> 00:27.694
It's all my fault.

00:28.903 --> 00:30.530
It's all because of me.

00:30.613 --> 00:31.990
Oh, Gun-woo…

00:32.073 --> 00:33.950
This is not on you.

00:35.368 --> 00:37.078
These things happen.

00:37.162 --> 00:37.996
MIN GANG-YONG

00:38.079 --> 00:40.206
Unexpected things come up.

00:40.707 --> 00:41.624
SIR, GUN-WOO NEEDS HELP

00:41.708 --> 00:46.421
But the most painful moments,
when you're at rock bottom,

00:47.255 --> 00:50.300
can become a turning point for the better.

00:52.260 --> 00:55.013
If I'd just done what they said,

00:55.930 --> 00:57.891
no one would've gotten hurt.

00:59.392 --> 01:01.186
That's all I can think about.

01:01.936 --> 01:04.981
No one wants you getting involved
in that shady deal.

01:05.482 --> 01:07.734
That's why everyone's helping you.

01:08.568 --> 01:11.446
I'd rather get hurt myself, Mom.

01:12.072 --> 01:12.947
Gun-woo.

01:13.531 --> 01:17.077
What would you have done
if Woo-jin said he'd do that?

01:18.953 --> 01:21.539
You would've stopped him no matter what.

01:23.041 --> 01:23.875
See?

01:23.958 --> 01:26.294
That's how everyone else feels now.

01:26.795 --> 01:28.254
So,

01:29.172 --> 01:30.590
let's get through this.

01:30.673 --> 01:34.010
Bad things will pass
if we just hang in there.

01:35.345 --> 01:37.555
Good things will come.

01:43.019 --> 01:43.853
Okay.

01:45.355 --> 01:46.397
Son.

01:47.190 --> 01:48.233
Stay strong.

01:50.068 --> 01:50.902
Okay.

01:52.153 --> 01:53.780
This will sting.

01:54.405 --> 01:56.324
Yes, it stings. Hang in there.

01:56.908 --> 01:58.368
I'll numb the area now.

01:59.244 --> 02:01.371
Wait.

02:01.454 --> 02:03.289
-Doctor.
-Yes?

02:03.373 --> 02:06.918
Please make it nice and pretty
so it doesn't scar.

02:07.418 --> 02:08.753
Understood, sir.

02:18.429 --> 02:20.849
-Just a quick sting.
-Wait!

02:23.977 --> 02:25.186
-Almost done.
-Ouch!

02:26.354 --> 02:27.605
All done.

02:36.364 --> 02:38.741
Sir, how's the pain?

02:40.994 --> 02:43.079
Ma'am, back in the day,

02:44.372 --> 02:48.626
I was stabbed in the stomach twice,
but I made a full recovery.

02:49.210 --> 02:50.545
Oh…

02:51.045 --> 02:54.090
Are you in a gang?

02:54.174 --> 02:55.717
Not at all.

02:56.926 --> 02:58.887
I'm a boxer, ma'am.

02:58.970 --> 03:01.973
I'm not a gangster or anything like that.

03:02.056 --> 03:03.183
-So…
-I see.

03:03.766 --> 03:05.143
Anyway,

03:06.477 --> 03:09.689
it's been a while since I stepped down
from the ring as a pro.

03:10.690 --> 03:13.776
But with this hand injury,
my fighting days are over.

03:14.277 --> 03:15.111
Well…

03:15.737 --> 03:17.655
Sir, you shouldn't fight.

03:18.239 --> 03:20.992
I must fight.

03:21.075 --> 03:23.369
You shouldn't fight with this hand.

03:23.453 --> 03:26.497
Ma'am, I'm Hong Woo-jin.

03:26.581 --> 03:28.082
If I can't fight,

03:28.666 --> 03:31.544
I'll become a nobody.

03:32.670 --> 03:34.172
I'm a boxer.

03:35.715 --> 03:37.717
I'm the invincible Marine Southpaw.

03:38.426 --> 03:39.761
Then you must fight.

03:41.054 --> 03:42.013
Fight.

03:42.847 --> 03:44.933
You can do it, okay?

03:52.232 --> 03:53.733
I have to fight.

04:00.657 --> 04:02.742
Sir, are you okay?

04:02.825 --> 04:05.828
Oh, this is nothing.

04:05.912 --> 04:08.790
The doctor stitched me up nice and pretty,

04:08.873 --> 04:11.668
so I won't need plastic surgery.

04:11.751 --> 04:15.088
This is really delicate work.

04:15.171 --> 04:18.675
If you botch it, you have to rip it out
and start from scratch.

04:19.175 --> 04:20.301
-That's a no.
-Right.

04:20.385 --> 04:23.304
My looks are all I've got.

04:23.888 --> 04:25.598
Hold on. Doctor!

04:26.641 --> 04:28.101
Well, goodness.

04:28.184 --> 04:31.729
If you ever need some fast cash,
please contact me anytime.

04:32.397 --> 04:33.356
Oh.

04:34.190 --> 04:35.024
Please.

04:35.525 --> 04:36.943
Take care.

04:37.694 --> 04:38.820
God.

04:40.238 --> 04:42.115
Damn, my head…

04:42.198 --> 04:43.992
You got injured because of me.

04:44.659 --> 04:46.119
I'm very sorry.

04:48.955 --> 04:49.789
Gun-woo.

04:52.083 --> 04:53.710
My God, have you been crying?

04:55.253 --> 04:56.087
Oh.

04:57.297 --> 04:58.715
Look at you.

05:00.800 --> 05:03.094
You have an iron fist…

05:04.929 --> 05:06.514
but a heart of cotton candy.

05:09.475 --> 05:10.393
I'm sorry.

05:11.644 --> 05:13.730
Promise me one thing.

05:15.982 --> 05:18.860
Here. Harden your heart

05:19.527 --> 05:21.487
like cast iron as well.

05:23.239 --> 05:25.992
That way, your people stay safe.

05:29.412 --> 05:30.246
Yes, sir.

05:33.166 --> 05:34.625
-Gun-woo.
-Yes.

05:35.877 --> 05:36.711
Hey, Woo-jin.

05:38.379 --> 05:39.547
-Oh.
-Damn.

05:39.630 --> 05:41.841
You haven't had your hand stitched up yet?

05:41.924 --> 05:43.760
They told me to wait an hour.

05:43.843 --> 05:47.013
The wound is so deep
that they're calling in a specialist.

05:47.096 --> 05:48.890
Good to know.

05:49.932 --> 05:51.517
Listen carefully.

05:52.643 --> 05:54.771
Consider skipping the anesthesia.

05:54.854 --> 05:57.106
-Stitches without anesthesia?
-Hey!

05:57.190 --> 06:00.151
I've got six injections on my dome.

06:00.234 --> 06:03.946
It hurt so much that I teared up,
but I only got four stitches.

06:04.030 --> 06:06.199
Forget the interest.
I didn't even get my principal back.

06:06.282 --> 06:07.158
GANG-YONG

06:07.241 --> 06:09.077
Sir, I'd need those shots…

06:09.160 --> 06:11.454
You don't. I'm telling you.

06:11.537 --> 06:12.372
But, sir…

06:12.455 --> 06:14.207
Okay, fine.

06:14.290 --> 06:16.667
Do you want a squeeze toy just in case?

06:18.002 --> 06:18.836
Hello, Gang-yong.

06:19.712 --> 06:22.382
Hey, champion. Where are you now?

06:23.049 --> 06:23.925
Well…

06:26.052 --> 06:28.388
I'm on my way to Min-beom's company.

06:28.471 --> 06:30.932
I don't know what's going on,
but I've got you.

06:31.015 --> 06:32.683
Don't worry, okay?

06:33.226 --> 06:35.019
We can get through this together.

06:35.645 --> 06:36.771
You got that?

06:37.688 --> 06:38.606
Yes, Gang-yong.

07:11.180 --> 07:13.182
BLOODHOUNDS 2

07:20.273 --> 07:22.650
Goodness, are you okay?

07:23.359 --> 07:25.528
Yes, thank you so much.

07:26.904 --> 07:27.947
We haven't met…

07:28.739 --> 07:30.700
He's a senior marine to Woo-jin and me.

07:30.783 --> 07:33.244
He helped us take out Kim Myeong-gil.

07:33.327 --> 07:34.912
I'm Moon Gwang-mu.

07:34.996 --> 07:37.415
I've heard so much about you.

07:38.124 --> 07:39.041
I'm Hong Min-beom.

07:39.125 --> 07:40.835
What an honor.

07:40.918 --> 07:44.589
I'm Min Gang-yong,
team leader at Seoul Metro Police.

07:44.672 --> 07:46.090
Yes, sir.

07:48.134 --> 07:50.761
-Sir, this is Tae-yeong--
-Of course I know.

07:50.845 --> 07:54.223
I helped move her IKEA desk last year.

07:54.307 --> 07:55.600
You remember me, right?

07:55.683 --> 07:57.018
Of course.

07:57.101 --> 07:58.853
Only Woo-jin was there back then.

07:58.936 --> 07:59.812
I see.

07:59.896 --> 08:01.731
Let's sit and talk.

08:01.814 --> 08:02.815
-Okay.
-Sure.

08:12.116 --> 08:13.784
If you don't mind me asking,

08:13.868 --> 08:15.828
what line of work are you in?

08:15.912 --> 08:19.790
Well, I run a small…

08:20.291 --> 08:23.294
I'm running a small loan company.

08:23.377 --> 08:25.505
I'm basically a small business owner.

08:32.678 --> 08:35.473
I know how you feel.

08:35.556 --> 08:36.641
But as for me,

08:36.724 --> 08:39.560
I learned the trade under Mr. Choi.

08:39.644 --> 08:43.022
I wouldn't do things
that go against my conscience.

08:45.233 --> 08:47.151
-It's Gwang-mu, right?
-Yes.

08:47.235 --> 08:49.237
I appreciate you helping Gun-woo,

08:49.987 --> 08:51.280
but I'm a cop.

08:51.906 --> 08:54.825
If I see you breaking the law,
I have to do my job.

08:54.909 --> 08:55.910
You understand, right?

08:56.702 --> 08:57.787
I sure do.

09:00.456 --> 09:02.542
Who's handling the break-in at your place?

09:02.625 --> 09:04.710
A detective at Incheon Station.

09:04.794 --> 09:06.045
Give me his number.

09:06.921 --> 09:11.342
If this ever happens again,
call me the first thing, okay?

09:11.425 --> 09:12.969
So I can sort it out faster.

09:14.345 --> 09:15.304
Will do.

09:16.305 --> 09:17.265
LEE WOO-JEONG
CLASS 39

09:23.646 --> 09:25.481
Excuse me. This is urgent.

09:25.565 --> 09:26.482
Sure.

09:31.112 --> 09:31.946
Hey, Woo-jeong.

09:32.446 --> 09:36.409
Sir, you arrested Kang In-beom
in 2021, right?

09:37.994 --> 09:38.911
Yes, why?

09:39.412 --> 09:40.454
So, Gun-woo.

09:40.538 --> 09:45.835
I've been looking into safe places
where your mom can stay comfortably.

09:45.918 --> 09:48.588
Unfortunately,
my hotel is still under construction.

09:49.297 --> 09:51.424
My friend runs the Marriott
in Times Square.

09:52.216 --> 09:55.177
I'll have a room
and a security team ready.

09:55.761 --> 09:58.681
Don't worry. I'll take good care of her.

09:59.223 --> 10:01.309
Is it okay to accept all this?

10:01.809 --> 10:04.729
Remember what you said last time
when we almost gave up?

10:06.063 --> 10:07.273
We'll help you.

10:07.857 --> 10:09.817
It's not over until it's over.

10:12.486 --> 10:14.572
You didn't give up.
That's how we're alive.

10:14.655 --> 10:15.781
This is nothing.

10:17.241 --> 10:20.494
I haven't even begun to pay you back.

10:21.787 --> 10:24.415
Anyway, your mother must be very shocked.

10:25.541 --> 10:26.667
Let's protect her.

10:27.460 --> 10:28.336
Yes.

10:35.092 --> 10:36.260
Gun-woo.

10:37.136 --> 10:38.512
This afternoon,

10:39.347 --> 10:40.598
Kang In-beom escaped.

10:43.976 --> 10:46.354
-What?
-The police are looking into it.

10:46.437 --> 10:48.356
They are trying to track him down.

10:49.231 --> 10:51.317
But this seems bigger than I thought.

11:21.013 --> 11:23.265
-I told you to bring her.
-I'm sorry.

11:23.349 --> 11:24.558
Hey, you fucker.

11:24.642 --> 11:27.687
I burn 300 million won a year
on your salary, you son of a bitch!

11:29.480 --> 11:30.439
I'm sorry, sir.

11:34.527 --> 11:37.321
Should I send your daughter
to an orphanage?

11:44.245 --> 11:45.079
I'm sorry.

11:47.790 --> 11:48.666
Do it right.

11:49.583 --> 11:50.418
Yes, sir.

11:53.212 --> 11:55.047
Fucking dumbass.

12:26.078 --> 12:27.079
Kang In-beom.

12:29.915 --> 12:31.250
Must be nice to be out.

12:37.214 --> 12:38.174
So,

12:39.258 --> 12:40.634
made up your mind?

12:48.058 --> 12:49.101
Work with me.

12:53.189 --> 12:54.774
Then you're set for life.

13:18.255 --> 13:20.299
Kang In-beom has a vendetta against us.

13:20.966 --> 13:23.260
Someone that driven is easy to manipulate.

13:24.094 --> 13:25.846
That's why they broke him out--

13:27.807 --> 13:31.852
The bastards want to leash a wild dog
to turn him into a bloodhound.

13:31.936 --> 13:33.395
Here's what worries me.

13:36.774 --> 13:40.110
In this country,
you don't just break out of prison.

13:40.820 --> 13:43.405
From what I heard,
the plan was pretty meticulous.

13:43.989 --> 13:45.241
They're using a pro.

13:45.741 --> 13:49.328
What if Kim Myeong-gil escapes too?

13:50.287 --> 13:51.288
Min-beom.

13:51.372 --> 13:55.167
Kim Myeong-gil is locked up on an island
20 km off the west coast.

13:55.251 --> 13:57.336
No one can break that bastard out.

13:57.419 --> 13:58.629
Don't worry.

14:01.215 --> 14:05.261
I told them to ramp up the surveillance
on Kim Myeong-gil and his crew.

14:05.344 --> 14:07.429
Don't you worry about a thing.

14:10.558 --> 14:13.394
Sir, I just remembered something.

14:13.477 --> 14:14.436
What is it?

14:15.020 --> 14:18.732
Back in the Cyber Investigation Division,
I shut down a site on the dark web.

14:18.816 --> 14:23.320
They specialized in contract killings,
but they also handled prison breaks.

14:23.404 --> 14:26.824
These people operate out of the dark web.

14:26.907 --> 14:29.159
And we never caught the site admin.

14:35.249 --> 14:38.252
If you don't have any other plans,

14:38.335 --> 14:40.796
should I look for the gangsters
who attacked us?

14:41.547 --> 14:43.173
You'll look for what?

14:43.257 --> 14:46.010
The gangsters who fought Woo-jin and me.

14:46.677 --> 14:47.511
Why?

14:47.595 --> 14:49.471
I'm trying to be helpful.

14:49.555 --> 14:51.807
I know people too.

14:52.308 --> 14:53.809
Look.

14:53.893 --> 14:56.270
I'm going to handle this by the book.

14:57.354 --> 14:58.397
Mr. Min.

14:59.231 --> 15:02.359
Not everything I do is illegal.

15:03.402 --> 15:05.195
I'll be the judge of that.

15:05.279 --> 15:08.824
Yeah, so just sit tight for now.

15:11.243 --> 15:12.077
Gang-yong.

15:16.373 --> 15:18.125
It's late.

15:18.208 --> 15:21.170
Let's get Gun-woo's mom
to the hotel first.

15:22.379 --> 15:23.672
Sure, let's do that.

15:30.387 --> 15:34.099
For fuck's sake.
Give me the damn money, you prick!

15:34.183 --> 15:36.143
You're asking the wrong person.

15:38.562 --> 15:40.147
Fucking hell.

15:40.648 --> 15:43.734
Hey, man,
I heard those fuckers were pro boxers.

15:44.234 --> 15:46.570
Fuck, you should've told me that!

15:46.654 --> 15:47.863
Hey.

15:48.447 --> 15:50.074
Calm down, will you?

15:50.157 --> 15:52.034
Calm down, my ass.

15:52.534 --> 15:53.369
Whatever.

15:54.328 --> 15:55.579
Do you see this?

15:56.080 --> 15:58.791
I need stitches for this gash
so it doesn't scar.

15:58.874 --> 16:00.334
So hand over the money.

16:03.087 --> 16:05.339
Let's talk outside, just us.

16:05.422 --> 16:08.133
Quit fucking playing
and cough it up, asshole.

16:19.228 --> 16:20.562
Fuck!

16:21.897 --> 16:23.357
Get off me, you fucker!

16:27.486 --> 16:29.363
I'm sorry!

16:29.446 --> 16:31.657
I'm very sorry, sir!

16:39.748 --> 16:41.208
Please stop.

16:46.547 --> 16:47.381
Bite it.

16:49.842 --> 16:51.510
Bite it.

16:52.386 --> 16:54.263
Please don't do this.

16:54.930 --> 16:56.098
Bite it, you fucker!

17:26.587 --> 17:27.588
Man-bae.

17:28.213 --> 17:29.423
Man-bae!

17:32.968 --> 17:34.678
Deal with this prick on your dime.

17:36.221 --> 17:37.056
Got it?

17:37.556 --> 17:39.349
-Yes, sir.
-Send the guys in.

17:39.433 --> 17:40.267
Yes, sir.

17:57.076 --> 17:59.578
Ms. Yoon, here's our Security Team 3.

17:59.661 --> 18:01.580
This is the lead and deputy lead.

18:01.663 --> 18:03.123
Oh, hello.

18:03.207 --> 18:06.168
I'm Joo Ji-uk. I'll keep you safe.

18:06.251 --> 18:07.503
I'm Ryu Gyeong-nam.

18:07.586 --> 18:10.172
So sorry to bother you at this hour.

18:10.255 --> 18:12.132
Your trip here must have been tiring.

18:12.758 --> 18:14.510
We've secured the safest room.

18:15.844 --> 18:17.096
It's late. Get some rest.

18:17.721 --> 18:19.014
Thank you, Min-beom.

18:19.765 --> 18:21.183
Thank you so much.

18:22.226 --> 18:23.811
-Get some rest.
-Thank you.

18:34.029 --> 18:35.364
Thank you.

18:38.492 --> 18:40.661
Ms. Yoon and Ms. Kang, right this way.

18:40.744 --> 18:43.080
And Mr. Kim, your room is this way.

18:43.914 --> 18:45.040
Thank you.

18:45.541 --> 18:47.668
If you need anything, please let us know.

18:47.751 --> 18:49.044
Yes, thank you.

18:49.128 --> 18:50.462
Thank you.

19:11.984 --> 19:13.110
Thank you.

19:22.286 --> 19:23.996
-Gun-woo.
-Woo-jin.

19:28.375 --> 19:29.334
How's your hand?

19:30.169 --> 19:32.254
Luckily, the skin on my palms is so thick

19:32.754 --> 19:35.299
that my nerves and tendons
weren't injured.

19:44.641 --> 19:47.060
I should've gotten there sooner.

19:48.687 --> 19:49.771
I'm sorry.

19:49.855 --> 19:52.774
What are you talking about?

19:52.858 --> 19:54.276
No need to be sorry.

19:54.359 --> 19:57.154
I didn't get stabbed in the gut
like last time.

19:57.237 --> 19:59.865
It's just a gash on my palm.

19:59.948 --> 20:01.783
How can you say that?

20:03.827 --> 20:06.705
Don't worry. All I need is a quick bite.

20:09.208 --> 20:12.211
I'm hungry. Let's get room service.

20:19.968 --> 20:21.178
Sir, are you okay?

20:21.261 --> 20:23.388
It's nothing serious.

20:24.640 --> 20:26.808
-I followed up on our call.
-Yes.

20:26.892 --> 20:30.229
A bunch of guys born in 1999
formed this Nine-Nine Gang.

20:30.312 --> 20:34.274
Apparently, the gang members
all drove matching British Grenadiers.

20:34.358 --> 20:37.694
Yeah, that off-roader.
It's gotta be those bastards.

20:38.278 --> 20:40.739
The bastards must have a base camp.

20:40.822 --> 20:41.865
Yes, in Yongsan.

20:43.450 --> 20:46.787
Oh my, you found it already
without me even asking.

20:47.371 --> 20:48.830
I thought you might need it.

20:50.374 --> 20:52.668
I love your go-getter attitude.

20:53.252 --> 20:57.589
What do you think I need now?

20:58.340 --> 20:59.883
-Coffee?
-Get moving.

21:42.217 --> 21:45.429
DU-YEONG

21:54.021 --> 21:56.023
I'm in a fucking foul mood.

21:56.523 --> 21:57.816
What's your move?

22:01.737 --> 22:02.571
What?

22:03.613 --> 22:05.282
I'll find Kim Gun-woo first.

22:06.241 --> 22:07.242
How?

22:08.577 --> 22:09.953
How?!

22:11.955 --> 22:13.248
Iil Group's son.

22:16.293 --> 22:18.086
The fucker is Gun-woo's friend.

22:18.670 --> 22:19.504
Bring him here.

22:20.297 --> 22:23.467
Kang In-beom is a wanted man.
It could work against us.

22:24.468 --> 22:26.928
I'll mobilize the bloodhounds myself.

22:27.471 --> 22:30.682
Fuck, you want more money?
Use your own goddamn cash.

22:33.810 --> 22:35.020
Yes, sir.

22:36.521 --> 22:37.356
And you?

22:38.273 --> 22:41.360
They contacted us
after seeing Adik's last payout.

22:41.443 --> 22:42.778
They want a meeting.

22:43.362 --> 22:45.030
I think they'll buy it this time.

22:48.533 --> 22:49.743
Listen up, everyone.

22:50.369 --> 22:53.830
To expand the operation,
we really need Gun-woo.

22:54.331 --> 22:56.291
Get me that bastard at all costs. Got it?

22:59.169 --> 23:00.045
You got that?

23:00.128 --> 23:01.380
Yes, sir.

23:09.137 --> 23:10.347
Are we all set?

23:10.430 --> 23:12.015
Consider it done.

23:21.733 --> 23:23.568
Yes, hello.

23:24.069 --> 23:28.031
Tomorrow at 11:00, Detective Choi
is meeting the lead investigator.

23:28.532 --> 23:30.826
He'll hand over the forensic evidence.

23:32.536 --> 23:33.787
What evidence?

23:34.413 --> 23:35.622
Money first.

23:36.123 --> 23:38.333
I'll wire it right away.

23:48.093 --> 23:50.429
TRANSFER, LEE MAN-BAE
20,000,000 WON

24:00.730 --> 24:01.648
We're in.

24:03.400 --> 24:04.734
What is this?

24:05.944 --> 24:07.320
It's you, Gun-woo.

24:08.905 --> 24:11.116
I think this was AI-generated.

24:11.199 --> 24:13.285
He has much sharper eyes.

24:13.368 --> 24:16.746
You've never taken a photo
with bloody fists, right?

24:18.081 --> 24:19.040
Never.

24:19.708 --> 24:22.127
Isn't this a violation of privacy?

24:22.210 --> 24:25.422
It is, but the site itself is illegal.

24:25.505 --> 24:28.383
Everything on the dark web is illegal.

24:29.593 --> 24:31.136
Give me one second.

24:34.806 --> 24:36.516
What does it say?

24:36.600 --> 24:40.770
"IKFC37 is a challenge tournament."

24:40.854 --> 24:42.939
"It will be held in Seoul this March."

24:43.023 --> 24:46.318
"The new WBC super middleweight champion,

24:46.401 --> 24:50.947
Kim Gun-woo the Scarface, will join
the tournament as the first contender."

24:51.823 --> 24:52.991
Scarface?

24:53.658 --> 24:54.826
Those bastards.

24:55.368 --> 24:57.370
They even created his ring name.

24:58.038 --> 24:59.831
What's a challenge tournament?

24:59.915 --> 25:03.710
The winner advances
to face the next challenger.

25:04.336 --> 25:05.837
If you win,

25:06.505 --> 25:08.131
you'll keep fighting.

25:09.007 --> 25:11.384
Let me look up the previous matches.

25:19.726 --> 25:21.061
What? Do you know him?

25:21.770 --> 25:23.438
He was Gun-woo's opponent

25:24.022 --> 25:25.065
in the title match.

25:25.815 --> 25:27.526
Wait. Please pause.

25:33.823 --> 25:34.658
THREAT DETECTED

25:34.741 --> 25:36.409
-What is this?
-What's wrong?

25:37.327 --> 25:39.162
Someone is planting a virus.

25:50.048 --> 25:50.882
FILE SYSTEM ERROR

26:07.983 --> 26:09.818
Why isn't it working?

26:28.712 --> 26:31.172
You should never turn on this computer.

26:31.256 --> 26:32.632
If you do,

26:33.550 --> 26:36.428
it'll connect us straight to those
who attacked us.

26:37.429 --> 26:38.847
I'm so sorry.

26:40.890 --> 26:42.892
Once we get our prize money,

26:43.893 --> 26:46.021
we'll get you a high-end laptop.

26:48.273 --> 26:50.150
Thanks for the offer.

26:58.867 --> 26:59.784
Get ready.

27:04.414 --> 27:05.248
Can I help you?

27:05.332 --> 27:07.751
I'm here to see Kim Gun-woo.

27:12.756 --> 27:14.549
-Oh.
-Wow.

27:14.633 --> 27:17.969
This is basically a hotel staycation.

27:18.637 --> 27:21.431
This is why you gotta make it big. See?

27:21.514 --> 27:23.600
-It totally changes your life.
-Please.

27:23.683 --> 27:25.435
-Please have a seat.
-Sure.

27:26.144 --> 27:26.978
Sir.

27:27.771 --> 27:30.523
You know the boxer who fought Gun-woo?

27:30.607 --> 27:32.150
-Yes, Adik.
-Yes.

27:32.233 --> 27:35.654
We saw some of the IKFC fight
before the laptop was hit.

27:35.737 --> 27:36.863
Adik was in it.

27:37.781 --> 27:41.409
The guys who hit our place snatched him
and forced him to fight.

27:41.910 --> 27:42.911
And

27:43.620 --> 27:45.038
he disappeared.

27:50.585 --> 27:52.337
He disappeared?

27:55.340 --> 27:56.966
Those bastards.

27:59.302 --> 28:02.305
They will stop at nothing
to get Gun-woo to fight.

28:04.265 --> 28:06.351
We all have to protect Gun-woo.

28:06.935 --> 28:08.061
Got it?

28:08.561 --> 28:09.396
Yes.

28:10.397 --> 28:11.231
Yes.

28:15.360 --> 28:17.487
What are you two going to do now?

28:17.987 --> 28:20.990
I'm meeting Gang-yong
and Detective Choi at 11:00.

28:21.074 --> 28:21.908
Okay.

28:25.328 --> 28:26.830
I was going to rest.

28:27.414 --> 28:31.167
Rest? When I'm running like crazy
after busting my dome?

28:33.086 --> 28:34.713
I guess I should run too?

28:37.424 --> 28:40.635
But, sir,
Woo-jin shouldn't use his hand yet.

28:41.428 --> 28:42.762
-Gun-woo.
-Yes?

28:43.680 --> 28:45.098
Then what about me?

28:46.933 --> 28:48.143
I can't even pick it up.

28:48.643 --> 28:49.853
It feels numb.

28:52.188 --> 28:53.815
I'll run with you, sir.

28:53.898 --> 28:56.067
But where are you going?

29:26.848 --> 29:27.682
Spotted.

29:32.312 --> 29:36.232
Are you tired of living?
You know how much fucking cash you owe me?

29:36.733 --> 29:39.319
You're supposed to call me first!

29:40.195 --> 29:43.698
Son of a bitch. Are you shitting me?
After all that cash I sank into you?

29:44.199 --> 29:46.034
You fucking prick!

29:47.160 --> 29:49.120
Fucking dickhead.

29:54.876 --> 29:56.252
It's just a gym.

29:56.878 --> 29:59.923
This is supposed to be
the Nine-Nine Gang's hideout.

30:00.006 --> 30:01.758
Are you… sure?

30:02.884 --> 30:04.135
Okay, then.

30:05.053 --> 30:06.930
Let's play it cool.

30:10.099 --> 30:12.101
I'm here for some proper training…

30:17.357 --> 30:18.691
Fuck, catch that bastard!

30:19.859 --> 30:21.611
Sir, no!

30:23.363 --> 30:25.114
-Catch him already!
-Get off!

30:25.198 --> 30:27.158
-Hurry, Sun-bo!
-Get off!

30:27.742 --> 30:28.910
Just get off!

30:29.619 --> 30:31.496
-Get in there! Grab them!
-Get lost!

30:33.915 --> 30:35.917
-Sir!
-The bastards are getting away!

30:36.000 --> 30:38.002
-Sir!
-Hurry! Get them!

30:38.878 --> 30:40.463
-Turn!
-The other way! Hurry!

30:41.631 --> 30:44.092
-Catch them!
-You fucking bastard!

30:45.510 --> 30:48.388
I'm at the nail salon in Daedong Mall.
There's a situation here.

30:49.472 --> 30:50.473
Stop!

30:51.933 --> 30:54.102
Wait! Don't do it!

30:54.185 --> 30:57.522
Wait. Let's not do this, okay?

30:58.189 --> 30:59.274
Like real men,

30:59.941 --> 31:00.817
we can talk.

31:01.401 --> 31:02.861
Let's talk it out, okay?

31:03.778 --> 31:04.946
Yes?

31:07.323 --> 31:08.157
Yes.

31:08.658 --> 31:09.784
Fuck you!

31:09.868 --> 31:12.287
-That little punk.
-Fuck you, son of a bitch!

31:12.370 --> 31:14.539
-Son of a bitch!
-Fuck off, bastard!

31:15.206 --> 31:16.916
The bastards just said, "Fuck off."

31:18.209 --> 31:19.335
Damn it.

31:19.419 --> 31:21.004
Fuck this. Let's split up!

31:22.797 --> 31:23.631
Hey!

31:26.050 --> 31:27.010
Wait!

31:33.558 --> 31:35.476
Hey, take out this bastard!

31:43.443 --> 31:44.861
Son of a bitch!

31:46.237 --> 31:47.739
You fucking bastard!

31:49.449 --> 31:51.826
Die, you fucking bastard!

31:55.997 --> 31:56.831
You!

31:57.874 --> 31:58.708
Sir!

31:58.791 --> 31:59.667
Damn it!

32:00.501 --> 32:01.586
Get off!

32:02.629 --> 32:04.339
You son of a bitch!

32:04.422 --> 32:05.256
Fuck!

32:08.051 --> 32:09.052
Damn it.

32:15.683 --> 32:16.684
-Yes!
-Yes!

32:24.067 --> 32:25.735
-You bastard!
-You fucking…

32:25.818 --> 32:27.654
Die, you fucker!

32:46.881 --> 32:48.424
-Freeze!
-Hey, give it up!

32:48.508 --> 32:50.093
Don't move!

32:50.593 --> 32:51.636
Hold it right there!

32:51.719 --> 32:53.805
-You crazy bastard, what?
-Split up!

32:53.888 --> 32:56.265
-Break it up!
-Crazy bastards!

32:56.349 --> 32:57.892
-Settle down!
-Go ahead!

32:57.976 --> 32:59.394
Shoot me, you fucking bastards!

32:59.477 --> 33:01.145
If you move, I'll shoot!

33:05.775 --> 33:06.943
Don't move!

33:07.026 --> 33:08.695
-Cuff them all.
-Line up.

33:22.542 --> 33:24.752
-I think that's him.
-Him?

33:33.886 --> 33:34.721
What was that?

33:35.555 --> 33:36.472
What happened?

33:45.773 --> 33:46.691
Gun-woo!

33:47.233 --> 33:49.694
Catch that bastard! The one in the hoodie!

33:50.319 --> 33:51.446
Detective Choi!

33:53.781 --> 33:54.782
Damn it!

33:55.992 --> 33:57.994
Detective Choi, stay with me.

34:10.214 --> 34:11.466
Detective Choi!

34:13.384 --> 34:14.218
Detective Choi!

34:32.445 --> 34:33.446
Damn it!

34:41.287 --> 34:42.830
Stop!

35:29.544 --> 35:30.586
Whoop!

36:18.092 --> 36:19.051
GANG-YONG

36:19.135 --> 36:22.638
I'M SORRY, GUN-WOO
I COULDN'T SAVE DETECTIVE CHOI GYEONG-WON

36:38.613 --> 36:40.198
WOO-JIN

36:42.200 --> 36:43.910
-Yes, Woo-jin.
-Gun-woo.

36:43.993 --> 36:45.995
-Yeah.
-Can you talk to Gang-yong?

36:46.078 --> 36:48.873
Will you two meet us here?

37:03.429 --> 37:04.889
Mr. Min!

37:08.309 --> 37:10.645
-Can I help you?
-Hello, Officer.

37:10.728 --> 37:14.398
I'm Min Gang-yong, Lead Investigator
for the Special Investigation Division.

37:14.482 --> 37:15.608
Sir!

37:15.691 --> 37:17.068
Where is the chief?

37:17.151 --> 37:18.527
Over there, sir.

37:19.028 --> 37:20.905
Could we have a moment?

37:20.988 --> 37:22.865
-Yes. This way, please.
-Thank you.

37:44.637 --> 37:46.347
How is your hand?

37:47.598 --> 37:49.767
-Well, it's just…
-Let me see.

37:51.060 --> 37:52.061
-It's nothing.
-Hey.

37:56.107 --> 37:57.733
I'm fine, okay?

37:58.234 --> 38:00.027
No need to worry.

38:12.039 --> 38:13.499
-Sergeant Lee.
-Yes, sir.

38:13.582 --> 38:16.752
The lead investigator
and I talked things through.

38:16.836 --> 38:19.922
You can uncuff those three.

38:20.006 --> 38:22.258
-Yes, sir.
-What's he saying?

38:22.341 --> 38:24.010
-Fucking bullshit!
-Settle down!

38:24.093 --> 38:27.096
Over there, be quiet! Sit down!

38:28.055 --> 38:31.726
It's not fair! They started it,
but we're the ones locked up!

38:31.809 --> 38:32.893
Sit down.

38:32.977 --> 38:35.146
Sit down? Fuck you!

38:35.229 --> 38:38.482
You are the police! This is not fair!

38:39.608 --> 38:40.609
What?

38:40.693 --> 38:41.569
Why?

38:42.069 --> 38:45.990
I took over this case.
Do you know what that means?

38:46.073 --> 38:48.451
If you keep acting up,

38:48.951 --> 38:52.163
I'll expose you
and call for victims to come forward.

38:53.205 --> 38:54.623
Shut up and listen.

38:55.541 --> 38:57.043
If your face gets out there,

38:57.543 --> 39:01.130
your siblings and relatives,
not to mention your parents,

39:01.881 --> 39:05.009
and I hope you don't,
but if you do have a girlfriend,

39:05.801 --> 39:08.137
will get a lot of calls.

39:08.220 --> 39:12.141
Then their business, work, and daily lives
will be completely upended.

39:13.225 --> 39:14.185
Should I do that?

39:15.561 --> 39:16.437
No, sir.

39:17.104 --> 39:18.189
What's your name?

39:18.981 --> 39:20.107
It's Gu Dong-yeok.

39:20.608 --> 39:22.651
Dong-yeok, I'll be watching you.

39:22.735 --> 39:23.569
Yes, sir.

39:27.031 --> 39:30.534
Thank you so much, sir.
I know how busy you are.

39:30.618 --> 39:32.661
But strictly speaking,

39:32.745 --> 39:35.039
it was self-defense.

39:36.874 --> 39:38.167
I told you to sit tight!

39:38.959 --> 39:40.086
I wanted to help--

39:40.169 --> 39:41.337
So did you?

39:41.921 --> 39:43.923
We found the guys who attacked us.

39:44.006 --> 39:46.008
The police would've caught them.

39:46.092 --> 39:49.387
But it's better
to work together like this.

39:53.307 --> 39:54.892
Can we have a word?

40:02.191 --> 40:04.402
If they make a wrong move
and we get exposed,

40:04.485 --> 40:07.113
all my plans will go out the window.

40:07.696 --> 40:08.656
I'm sorry.

40:09.156 --> 40:11.367
What I did was wrong. I mean that.

40:14.203 --> 40:17.498
But can't you let me pitch in?

40:18.999 --> 40:20.459
I mean,

40:20.960 --> 40:24.672
I'm an uneducated loan shark.

40:24.755 --> 40:26.632
You are not thrilled. I get that.

40:27.341 --> 40:29.760
But not all loan sharks are bad people.

40:29.844 --> 40:31.429
President Choi mentored me.

40:31.512 --> 40:35.975
And he was a truly remarkable man.
Ask these boys.

40:37.184 --> 40:40.855
I try every day to live up to his example.

40:41.439 --> 40:43.149
Besides, they are bad guys.

40:43.232 --> 40:45.401
Can't we play a bit dirty to nail them?

40:45.484 --> 40:46.318
Gwang-mu.

40:50.364 --> 40:51.198
Look.

40:51.282 --> 40:54.452
I'm not afraid of getting my hands dirty.

40:54.535 --> 40:56.620
Getting it done is my top priority.

40:56.704 --> 40:59.498
To get it done,
dirty or clean doesn't matter to me.

40:59.582 --> 41:00.916
But the problem is

41:01.417 --> 41:04.086
that you don't listen to me.

41:04.170 --> 41:07.006
That messes up all my plans!

41:11.677 --> 41:12.761
I apologize.

41:12.845 --> 41:15.598
I'll follow your instructions.

41:15.681 --> 41:16.557
But please…

41:18.517 --> 41:20.895
let me help.

41:24.440 --> 41:27.443
I'm here because of these boys.

41:28.068 --> 41:31.197
Like you, I'd like to do my fair share.

41:32.573 --> 41:35.743
Let me act like a proper senior
to these boys.

41:46.921 --> 41:48.172
Later tonight,

41:48.923 --> 41:50.633
grill Gu Dong-yeok

41:51.258 --> 41:53.219
and find out who's behind the attack.

41:54.386 --> 41:55.638
Yes, sir.

41:56.138 --> 41:57.723
-I'll do as you say.
-Oh…

42:01.894 --> 42:02.895
Okay.

42:04.063 --> 42:05.564
What are you doing? Get in.

42:05.648 --> 42:06.815
-Okay.
-Me too.

42:25.417 --> 42:26.669
Hello.

42:26.752 --> 42:29.129
-Which room?
-Please go to room seven.

42:33.509 --> 42:35.928
What are you doing after work?
Let's get a drink.

42:36.887 --> 42:38.097
Room seven, please.

42:43.477 --> 42:45.104
What a pig.

42:49.233 --> 42:50.693
Hello.

42:51.318 --> 42:53.112
-Hello.
-Hello.

43:01.662 --> 43:02.705
Moa.

43:03.205 --> 43:05.874
-How is business?
-Good, thanks to you.

43:06.375 --> 43:10.004
-What happened to your face?
-It's nothing.

43:10.504 --> 43:11.422
Well, Moa.

43:11.922 --> 43:16.176
I'll deduct double today's sales
from your interest.

43:16.260 --> 43:17.761
Please pull down the shutters.

43:19.763 --> 43:22.266
Which room is that meathead in?

43:22.349 --> 43:23.517
He's in room seven.

43:24.435 --> 43:25.728
Lucky number seven.

43:35.154 --> 43:36.739
Come in.

43:43.662 --> 43:45.497
Relax, sir.

43:45.998 --> 43:47.708
Arms up.

43:48.751 --> 43:50.002
Thank you.

43:52.004 --> 43:52.880
What the hell?

43:52.963 --> 43:55.674
What the hell, you bastards?

43:55.758 --> 43:58.844
-Fuck.
-What else? It's a massage.

43:58.927 --> 44:03.265
You'd better think twice
before fighting back.

44:03.349 --> 44:05.893
It wouldn't be the first time
a neck snapped

44:05.976 --> 44:07.728
while getting a very firm massage.

44:07.811 --> 44:09.605
You get the picture?

44:09.688 --> 44:11.857
Fuck you, you fucking bastard.

44:12.566 --> 44:15.527
That's no way to talk to an adult,
you punk.

44:15.611 --> 44:18.280
Hey, I'm a professional.

44:19.740 --> 44:23.327
I didn't want to be, but here I am.

44:23.410 --> 44:24.411
Why?

44:25.079 --> 44:26.205
Because I'm too good.

44:26.955 --> 44:30.542
Dong-yeok, you little punk.
Let's do a routine checkup.

44:30.626 --> 44:31.460
Traps.

44:32.294 --> 44:33.420
Bad.

44:34.088 --> 44:35.881
Lats. Underwhelming.

44:35.964 --> 44:38.842
Spinal erectors. Terrible.

44:40.427 --> 44:42.429
But the worst of all is…

44:42.513 --> 44:43.806
What the…

44:43.889 --> 44:44.807
What the hell?

44:45.307 --> 44:48.102
Your sphincter, you bastard.

44:48.185 --> 44:49.853
This spot is sensitive,

44:49.937 --> 44:54.024
so the pain is two or three times worse.

44:54.108 --> 44:56.819
Look at this. It won't go in, you bastard.

44:56.902 --> 45:00.489
No, stop!

45:00.572 --> 45:03.117
Now, I'll be asking you some questions.

45:03.200 --> 45:07.496
Answer me truthfully,
or you'll spend the next month in diapers.

45:07.579 --> 45:08.956
Question.

45:09.832 --> 45:11.667
Who ordered the hit?

45:11.750 --> 45:13.419
My boss did.

45:14.211 --> 45:15.254
Who's your boss?

45:15.337 --> 45:18.006
It's Du-seong. Fuck, you're in deep shit.

45:18.090 --> 45:20.092
Where could he be now?

45:20.175 --> 45:21.510
I don't know.

45:21.593 --> 45:23.011
You don't?

45:23.512 --> 45:25.013
-I really don't.
-Well, then.

45:25.097 --> 45:27.266
I promise you a life of no constipation.

45:27.349 --> 45:31.145
Well, I'm going in. Let's get in there!

45:31.228 --> 45:32.938
It's halfway in!

45:33.021 --> 45:36.400
Hey, relax.
You're shitting yourself, you bastard!

45:36.483 --> 45:39.862
-Oh my, what do we do?
-I'm telling you the truth!

45:41.572 --> 45:42.740
Fuck.

45:43.991 --> 45:45.284
Fuck…

45:46.994 --> 45:48.829
I really don't know.

45:50.038 --> 45:52.583
The bastard is telling the truth.

45:53.167 --> 45:56.128
Then do you know who Adik is?

45:56.211 --> 46:00.340
I do. I saw him fighting a few days ago.

46:01.508 --> 46:02.342
Where?

46:02.426 --> 46:05.763
I saw Adik and a long-haired dude

46:05.846 --> 46:08.182
fighting at a closed subway station.

46:08.265 --> 46:09.641
I was standing there.

46:09.725 --> 46:10.976
A long-haired dude? Who?

46:11.059 --> 46:13.020
I don't know.

46:13.103 --> 46:14.062
You don't?

46:14.146 --> 46:17.024
I really don't know. Wait!

46:17.524 --> 46:19.610
I can't think with my head pinned down.

46:24.198 --> 46:27.159
-Sun-bo, he says the pressure is too much.
-Okay.

46:29.953 --> 46:31.038
Go ahead.

46:32.414 --> 46:35.250
I took a photo with my phone.

46:35.334 --> 46:37.836
It's not exactly a photo of him.

46:37.920 --> 46:41.590
But I took a picture
of the watch he was wearing.

46:41.673 --> 46:45.385
It was a fucking pricey one,
so I took a photo to flex it on Instagram.

46:45.886 --> 46:49.598
I praise you for your little selfie game.

46:50.224 --> 46:53.143
Snap and post a photo
of this place too, okay?

46:53.227 --> 46:54.061
Okay.

46:55.479 --> 46:56.563
Fuck…

46:56.647 --> 46:59.107
Wait, guys. I mean, excuse me!

46:59.191 --> 47:01.360
Damn it, fucking uncuff me before you go!

47:08.450 --> 47:10.619
MOON GWANG-MU

47:14.748 --> 47:16.667
What am I supposed to do with this?

47:17.501 --> 47:18.335
Woo-jeong.

47:18.418 --> 47:19.503
Yes, sir.

47:19.586 --> 47:21.338
-Come. Take a look.
-Sure.

47:22.589 --> 47:23.966
You're a watch expert, yes?

47:24.883 --> 47:26.844
Yes, I've done my homework.

47:26.927 --> 47:29.763
Good. Look at this. Could this be a lead?

47:31.807 --> 47:33.267
Let me see.

47:33.767 --> 47:35.018
I'll look into that.

47:37.437 --> 47:39.773
-I'll see what I can find.
-Thanks.

47:41.984 --> 47:43.652
Doors closing.

47:46.280 --> 47:48.282
Hye-seon, ice cream!

47:50.784 --> 47:51.618
Hye-seon!

48:08.886 --> 48:10.137
Mr. Cho Won-yeong.

48:11.179 --> 48:12.055
Right now--

48:12.139 --> 48:14.224
Please don't do this.

48:18.896 --> 48:20.731
Let him finish. Got it?

48:20.814 --> 48:21.815
Okay.

48:23.150 --> 48:24.985
You heard him.

48:25.485 --> 48:28.030
-So don't interrupt me and listen.
-Okay.

48:28.113 --> 48:29.156
Right now,

48:29.907 --> 48:34.036
he's rubbing numbing cream
onto your sister's hand.

48:34.119 --> 48:36.747
Do you see the man next to her?

48:36.830 --> 48:37.664
Yes.

48:40.250 --> 48:43.295
Answer my questions promptly,

48:43.378 --> 48:45.964
and you two will be just fine.

48:46.048 --> 48:46.882
Okay.

48:47.674 --> 48:48.842
So…

48:49.885 --> 48:52.220
Where is Kim Gun-woo?

48:53.221 --> 48:56.433
I… don't know.

49:06.443 --> 49:08.820
Wait! I'll tell you!

49:08.904 --> 49:10.197
I'll tell you!

49:12.658 --> 49:15.744
At the Marriott Hotel in Yeongdeungpo.

49:16.620 --> 49:19.039
At the Marriott. What's the room number?

49:20.123 --> 49:21.083
Room 1602.

49:21.166 --> 49:23.335
-Room 1602.
-Yes.

49:24.419 --> 49:26.004
Isn't Min Gang-yong

49:27.214 --> 49:28.465
Hong Min-beom's relative?

49:30.884 --> 49:32.010
I'm just wondering.

49:33.428 --> 49:34.763
What's Hong Min-beom doing

49:35.806 --> 49:37.766
tomorrow evening?

49:51.071 --> 49:51.905
BLOODHOUNDS
SEOUL

49:51.989 --> 49:54.074
LOOKING FOR SOMEONE TO WORK
TOMORROW EVENING

49:54.700 --> 49:56.118
And the drug for tomorrow?

50:01.915 --> 50:03.083
One drop will do.

50:04.751 --> 50:06.128
Can I mix it with alcohol?

50:06.753 --> 50:07.963
Mix it with alcohol?

50:09.673 --> 50:11.758
Fuck, I'm really curious what'll happen.

50:12.592 --> 50:14.386
It shouldn't kill him.

50:15.262 --> 50:16.346
He won't die.

50:18.890 --> 50:20.308
PSYCHO69
I'LL DO IT

50:51.256 --> 50:53.216
We're not open yet.

50:53.300 --> 50:55.719
Ma'am, we're not open yet.

50:56.219 --> 50:57.387
You can't come in.

51:08.690 --> 51:10.150
What did you just…

51:26.500 --> 51:28.752
It'll wear off in two to three hours.

51:52.442 --> 51:54.402
When does Hong Min-beom get here?

51:55.779 --> 51:57.072
Eight o'clock.

51:57.155 --> 51:58.573
And drinks?

51:59.491 --> 52:00.367
What's his usual?

52:36.653 --> 52:37.988
You want a drink, Won-yeong?

52:38.071 --> 52:39.948
Seriously, I'm only having one.

52:40.448 --> 52:41.950
I'll wait and drive you home.

52:42.033 --> 52:44.202
Okay, maybe next time.

53:12.647 --> 53:13.899
Good evening.

53:15.775 --> 53:18.278
Where is Dong-u?

53:18.778 --> 53:22.157
He's not feeling well,
so I'm covering for him.

53:23.158 --> 53:26.328
Please have a seat.
You're President Hong Min-beom, right?

53:26.411 --> 53:27.245
I am.

53:27.329 --> 53:29.956
Here's the Bowmore 27 you reserved.

53:50.518 --> 53:51.895
Thank you.

56:56.037 --> 57:01.042
Subtitle translation by: Jooyea Lee
